{
  "description": "Contrast fixtures for diligent-assess. Ratios are computed with the WCAG 2.x formula in f64 from the sRGB values; boundary pairs were found by scanning all 16.7M colors against white. Translucent colors are composited over the background with channel = floor(fg*a + bg*(1-a) + 0.5). needs_review means the harness must not decide.",
